ame><surname>Wong</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Sung</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Chung</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Endoscopic balloon dilatation for benign gastric outlet obstruction with or without Helicobacter pylori infection</article-title><source>Gastrointest Endosc</source><year>2004</year><volume>60</volume><fpage>229</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15278050</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0016-5107(04)01569-X</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>